Update the pinned Boogie release to 3.5.5-review.27e27ebc, including the pooled-solver idle-handshake repair for https://github.com/erniecohen/dafny/issues/287 and the canonical native map payload repair for https://github.com/erniecohen/dafny/issues/284. Healthy handshakes no longer retire a solver after 100 ms. Verification conditions are unchanged by the handshake repair, but retained pooled history can change later resource counts and outcomes at a resource limit; restart-per-batch measurements should be unaffected. Boogie's hidden /legacySolverIdleTimeout:1 restores the old deadline for comparison.
